  "body": "16/245 Kepa Road, Mission Bay\r\n\r\nDiscover a refreshing approach to modern living in one of Auckland's most desirable coastal suburbs. Combining contemporary design, everyday convenience and a peaceful natural setting, this stylish two-bedroom, two-bathroom townhouse offers an exceptional opportunity to enjoy more of life with less to maintain.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a busy professional, a couple, a downsizer or simply looking for an easy-care Auckland base, this home offers the perfect balance of comfort, convenience and lifestyle.\r\n\r\nModern Design. Comfortable Living.\r\nStep inside and discover a welcoming living space where contemporary style meets everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living, dining and kitchen areas create an inviting setting for relaxing, entertaining or simply enjoying time at home. Attractive flooring, a modern kitchen and thoughtfully arranged interiors give the home a clean, contemporary feel.\r\n\r\nSliding doors connect the living area to a private outdoor courtyard, creating a natural extension of the home and an inviting space for morning coffee, relaxed weekends or casual entertaining.\r\nUpstairs, two bedrooms and two bathrooms provide comfortable accommodation and flexibility for a range of lifestyles.\r\n\r\nLow Maintenance. More Living.\r\nOne of this home's greatest attractions is its easy-care lifestyle.\r\n\r\nWith its contemporary brick exterior, manageable outdoor space and practical two-level layout, this property is ideal for those who would rather spend their weekends enjoying life than maintaining a large home and garden.\r\n\r\nA dedicated off-street car park adds everyday convenience, while the lock-up-and-leave appeal makes this an excellent choice for busy professionals, downsizers or anyone seeking greater freedom and flexibility.\r\n\r\nWalk to the Shops. Drive to the Beach. Step into Nature.\r\nLocation is where this home truly shines.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the convenience of having Eastridge Shopping Centre and New World supermarket within walking distance, making everyday shopping, coffee stops and essential errands wonderfully easy.\r\n\r\nWhen the coast calls, Mission Bay Beach is just a short drive away, offering waterfront cafés, restaurants, scenic walks and the relaxed atmosphere that makes Auckland's eastern bays so popular.\r\n\r\nAnd for those who appreciate nature, Kepa Bush Reserve is right on your doorstep. With convenient gated pedestrian access from the development, peaceful green surroundings and walking tracks are ready to explore whenever you feel like escaping the pace of the day.\r\n\r\nHere, urban convenience, coastal enjoyment and natural beauty come together in one outstanding location.\r\n\r\nA Home Designed Around Your Lifestyle.\r\nImagine starting your morning with a coffee in your private courtyard, enjoying a peaceful walk through the nearby reserve, or heading to the waterfront for a relaxed afternoon.\r\n\r\nThis is a home that makes everyday living feel simple, comfortable and enjoyable, without the demands of a larger property.\r\n\r\nA fantastic opportunity to secure a contemporary, easy-care home in a sought-after Mission Bay location.\r\nLess Maintenance. More Living.\r\n\r\nContact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit our next open home.",
